{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1265.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"3cadd35fee7671cf3288196b32a2c42403196bac590e0521c1877b355568f187","ja":"どうしたの、風花ちゃん？\n何にそんなに驚いて……あら、それSNSの書き込み？","zh":"怎么了，风花？\n在为什么事这么惊讶……哎呀，那是社交平台的帖子吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1265.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"5f668d331cb374e97636ed2357b9591bb8dcf887ab0dec4fdf52230caf4add8a","ja":"「公園で見かけた風花ちゃん、\n濡れた姿がめっちゃセクシーだった！」","zh":"“在公园看到的风花，\n浑身湿透的样子超级性感！”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1265.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"35da0f8595390017e959378bb4e0906c0dc667d4b752485207b4ea93d704ac99","ja":"わぁ♪\n風花さん、またまたSNSで大好評ですね！","zh":"哇♪\n风花小姐，在社交平台上又大获好评了呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1265.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"5661d623b08ad103e367e8cbb20acaca72ef0b66034c7d59a123415318dd64f4","ja":"そ、そんな～！？\nあれは不可抗力で……うう……。","zh":"怎、怎么会这样～！？\n那明明是不可抗力……呜呜……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1265.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"2b3a31071b4cabee9e3735d84d2754b19262922473a731ff72e91d981de8404b","ja":"そんなに落ち込まないで！　……ほら、\n他にもいろんな感想が書き込まれてるみたいよ？","zh":"别那么沮丧嘛！……你看，\n好像还写了许多其他感想哦？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1265.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"6483394c7a803b84d6a709d89626eeb5f5790b51387bb2a9afad11b41d1d5741","ja":"例えば……「イベントで微笑む風花ちゃん、\n爽やかですっごくかわいかった！」、ですって♪","zh":"比如……“在活动中微笑的风花，\n既清爽又超级可爱！”，这样写的哦♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1265.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"b121921766c605124dfde6b5b98a48a6be8f67e20dadb03e97223340d25f43d0","ja":"えっ……！　ほ、本当ですか！？","zh":"咦……！真、真的吗！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1265.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"b6f95f4486f1752b3a0cb076d0039f56aa2eece77b733f75bd92391b8080d34b","ja":"風花さんの正統派アイドルの魅力も、ちゃんと\nみんなに伝わってる、ってことですね♪","zh":"风花身为正统派偶像的魅力，也好好地\n传达给所有人了呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
